.IX Title "CNFSHEADCONF 8"
.TH CNFSHEADCONF 8 2022-07-10 "INN 2.7.4" "InterNetNews Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
cnfsheadconf \- Read and write CNFS headers
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBcnfsheadconf\fR [\fB\-hw\fR] [\fB\-c\fR \fIclass\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fIcnfsheadconf\fR reads \fIpathetc\fR/cycbuff.conf and \fIpathetc\fR/storage.conf
to determine which CNFS buffers are available.  It then reads all of them
or the specified cyclic buffer via the \fB\-c\fR flag, and modifies the header
as directed by the interactive user if \fB\-w\fR is used.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP "\fB\-c\fR \fIclass\fR" 4
.IX Item "-c class"
Print the status of the specified class.  It also modifies it in case \fB\-w\fR
is used.
.IP \fB\-h\fR 4
.IX Item "-h"
Print usage information and exit.
.IP \fB\-w\fR 4
.IX Item "-w"
Prompt for modifications to make to cycbuff header.
.SH "تاریخچه (HISTORY)"
.IX Header "HISTORY"
Written by Katsuhiro Kondou <kondou@nec.co.jp> for InterNetNews.  Converted
to POD by Julien Elie.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
cycbuff.conf(5), inn.conf(5), storage.conf(5).
